     "bone": "right hand"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "OH_Special",
   "description": "Bowling roll (owner's wish): brings the ball back behind him, steps forward low into a classic bowler's lunge, swings the arm forward and releases the ball along the ground in front of him ('ball_release' at the release), follow-through with the arm up, then a little fist pump.",
   "frames": [
